Continue. Do not wait for guidance.

Fix the color sampling like this:
1. Do NOT run inline node -e scripts. Write the script to a file,
   /scripts/sample-colors.mjs, then run it with node. This avoids the
   JSON escaping errors.
2. Use this exact logic:

   import sharp from "sharp";
   const file = "public/vault-frames/f_001.webp";
   const { data, info } = await sharp(file)
     .removeAlpha()
     .raw()
     .toBuffer({ resolveWithObject: true });
   const { width, height, channels } = info;
   const px = (xp, yp) => {
     const x = Math.min(width - 1, Math.round(width * xp));
     const y = Math.min(height - 1, Math.round(height * yp));
     const i = (y * width + x) * channels;
     return "#" + [data[i], data[i + 1], data[i + 2]]
       .map(v => v.toString(16).padStart(2, "0")).join("");
   };
   console.log({ width, height, channels,
     topLeft: px(0.03, 0.03), topRight: px(0.97, 0.03),
     midLeft: px(0.03, 0.5), midRight: px(0.97, 0.5),
     bottomLeft: px(0.03, 0.97), bottomRight: px(0.97, 0.97) });

3. If sharp still fails after one retry, STOP debugging. Use these
   fallback values and note it in /docs/decisions.log:
   top #C9D0D2, middle #D5DBDC, bottom #E1E7E8.
4. Sample only edge regions (3% and 97%). Never sample the center. The
   vault sits there.
5. Do not spend more than 2 more tool calls on sampling. Then build the
   hero. Work through the full spec in order without stopping to check
   in. Only stop if a build error blocks you.
6. At the end, report what you built and any values you changed.

Stop. Your tool calls are printing as text. Do not write public/noise.svg.
Drop the noise overlay entirely. Use this CSS-only grain instead, inside
tokens.css or hero.css, no markup, no data URIs:

.hero-page::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0.04;
  background-image: repeating-radial-gradient(
    circle at 17% 23%, #000 0, transparent 1px, transparent 3px);
}

Rules from now on:
1. Never put raw HTML, SVG, or JSX angle brackets in a tool call that
   prints as text. If a call fails once, switch to bash and write the file
   with a heredoc: cat > path <<'EOF' ... EOF
2. One file per call. Max 80 lines.
3. After each file run ls to confirm it exists.
4. Order: tokens.css, hero.css, HeroCopy.tsx, HeroVault.tsx,
   hero-timeline.ts, HeroButtons.tsx.
5. Do not stop to ask. Start with tokens.css now.

{"kind":"tool","id":"aoeD6pMGlAA","toolName":"write_file","input":{"path":"src/styles/hero-tokens.css","instructions":"Hero design tokens: colors, type scale, spacing, durations from spec","content":"/* Hero tokens — VaultPay AI landing top. Spec-driven values only. */

:root {
  /* light studio theme, sampled from frame edges */
  --hero-bg-top: #C9D0D2;
  --hero-bg-mid: #D5DBDC;
  --hero-bg-bot: #E1E7E8;

  /* type: Fraunces (display), JetBrains Mono (eyebrow/chips), Inter (body) */
  --hero-eyebrow: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
  --hero-display: "Fraunces", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --hero-body: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;

  /* copy sizes — base 16, x1.618 */
  --hero-step-base: 16px;
  --hero-step-0: clamp(42px, 4.7vw, 68px);   /* H1 */
  --hero-step-1: 26px;
  --hero-step-2: 42px;
  --hero-step-3: 68px;
  --hero-step-4: 110px;

  /* spacing: fibonacci 8/13/21/34/55/89 */
  --hero-s-8: 8px;
  --hero-s-13: 13px;
  --hero-s-21: 21px;
  --hero-s-34: 34px;
  --hero-s-55: 55px;
  --hero-s-89: 89px;

  /* colors */
  --hero-ink: #0E1520;
  --hero-slate: #4B5663;
  --hero-steel: #8A95A1;
  --hero-brass: #B8893A;
  --hero-brass-light: #E2B867;
  --hero-teal: #12A5B5;
  --hero-success: #1F9D6B;

  /* durations from phi set */
  --hero-d-236: 0.236s;
  --hero-d-382: 0.382s;
  --hero-d-618: 0.618s;
  --hero-d-1: 1s;
  --hero-d-1618: 1.618s;
  --hero-d-2618: 2.618s;

  /* button geometry */
  --hero-btn-h: 55px;
  --hero-btn-r: 13px;
  --hero-btn-gap: 21px;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  :root {
    --hero-d-236: 0.001s;
    --hero-d-382: 0.001s;
    --hero-d-618: 0.001s;
    --hero-d-1: 0.001s;
    --hero-d-1618: 0.001s;
    --hero-d-2618: 0.001s;
  }
}
"}}
