## Snapshot

`40f2106` ("checkpoint: signup v1") → tag `signup-v1-stable` → branch `feat/signup-polish`. As instructed, `git add -A` also swept your two pre-existing deletions (`vault-scroll-2.html`, `vault-scroll-3.html`) into that checkpoint.

```
