| client step 2 | 543.6 | 543.6 | 543.6 | 659 |
| input height | 55 | 55 | 55 | 55 |
| role card | 185 × **89**, gap 13 | 185 × 89 | 185 × 89 | 145.5 × 89 |
| rail | 233 wide | 233 | 186.5 | compact row |
| rail → card | 35.6 | 35.6 | 21 | — |
| card → vault | 14.4 | 136.1 | 16.5 | — |
| card edges | 124.6 / 775.4 | 214.6 / 865.4 | **34.6 / 685.4** | flows |

At 1280×620 the card clamps to 565 and scrolls inside itself (content 649). 1024–1280 leaves only 2.3–16.5px to the vault's first dark pixel, because a 453 card centred on 38.2% reaches that far; no overlap.

