- **Rail width is capped by the strip the card leaves** (`min(233px, 38.2vw − 302.5px)`): at 1280 that's 186.5, at 1100 it's 117.7. A flat 233 would overlap the card by 80px at 1100, which your own verify forbids. Consequence: at 1100 the rail is 714 tall (fits 720 with 3px to spare; below ~730 it would clip).
- **Change role sits on the heading row next to the sub**, not beside the H1 glyphs: 453 − 68 leaves 385px, the H1 is ~305, so a chip beside it wraps "Open your vault."
