**What shipped (5 commits, pushed, deployed, verified on https://vault-lance-ai.vercel.app):**

| | before | now |
|---|---|---|
| curtain gone, your real network | 28.9 s (timed out at 25 s) | **4.1 s** |
| gate release | never (gave up) | 3.1 s |
| intro demo | stalled on a blank gate | plays both phases |

**Measured causes, in order of impact**

