## Flows (Playwright, mock API)

Authorize Landing Page → held + `PAYMENT.AUTHORIZED` + funds 2,580 → **2,880** · hold 0.8s and release → still audited, ring drained · full hold → unlocked + `PAYMENT.CAPTURED` + `FILES.UNLOCKED` + toast + KPIs 1,260 → **480** · reject Logo Pack (held) → voided + `PAYMENT.VOIDED` + **2,700** · Space-hold → unlocked · screen-reader "Confirm approval" → unlocked · join `DEMO-1234` → *Demo Project* · bad code → *Code not found.* · search "brand" → Brand Guide only · `freelancer@…` → coming-soon page with the rail · signed-out `/dashboard` → `/signin` · sign out → `/` with storage cleared · toasts cap at 3 · no console errors.

