The audit room is finished and verified: `/vault/:id` now runs the whole arc from a locked delivery to a captured payment, and every state and width in the spec rendered clean in a browser.

![Audit room at 1440x900, audited](/docs/room/matrix/audited-1440x900.png)

**Commits on `feat/audit-room`** (base tagged `room-v0-pre`)

- `f95eaea` feat(vault): the audit room at /vault/:id — shell, stepper, files, chat, checks, decision, entrance
- `69d7534` fix(vault): fit the room's content to its columns — clipping, 233px panel, phone void menu, screenshots
- `86da322` fix(vault): make the check card 89px with its border
