**Files changed:** new [vault.css](src/styles/vault.css), [AuditRoom.tsx](src/pages/vault/AuditRoom.tsx) and eight components in [src/components/vault](src/components/vault); additive edits to [api.ts](src/lib/api.ts) (`auditVault` now returns `{ route }`), routes in [App.tsx](src/App.tsx), and one change in [VaultCard.tsx](src/components/dashboard/VaultCard.tsx) so "Audit now" navigates instead of faking a result. The hold button, chip and toaster were already shared from the dashboard commit.

**Measured at 1440x900:** top bar 55, stepper 89 (glass, page padding), columns 254 / 665 / 411 (0.618 : 1.618 : 1), checks 468, decision 233, composer 621x99 with a 55px input and 55x55 send, bubble max 61.8% (57.7% measured on the opening line), check card 367x89. At 1920x1080: 346 / 905 / 559.

