| Pair | Ratio |
|---|---|
| chip TEST LOG / DEMO CACHE (slate on glass) | 6.89 |
| chip HTTP PROBE (teal on glass) | 5.82 |
| chip BROWSER TEST (teal on teal 12%) | 5.17 |
| chip PIXEL SCAN (brass on brass 12%) | 5.51 |
| check name, pass / warn | 17.37 / 15.54 |
