| reject & void / run checks | 6.75 / 5.82 |
| approve label on brass / status chip | 16.88 / 5.29 |

**Values I changed, and why**

- **Stepper mapping.** The map lit the *next* phase (awaiting showed Authorized, held showed Audited) which contradicted "held = Authorized done". It now beats on the last completed phase: 0 / 1 / 2 / all-done.
- **Fee labels** "VAULTLANCE FEE 5%" and "FREELANCER RECEIVES" became "FEE 5%" and "FREELANCER", and the amount and breakdown share one row. With the full labels the 233px panel scrolled its own hint and void button off the bottom.
- **File rows:** name over size, with the 34px Download on that second line. At 0.618fr (254px) the name was clipped to "logo-prim…"; folders get the toggle only.
- **Check cards:** name on its own line, chip beside the detail — the chip was ellipsizing "Transparent background".
- Chip text uses #0A6A74 / #7A551A rather than raw teal/brass so the 12% fills clear 4.5:1.
- The phone had no way to void a hold (the decision panel is a bar), so the Checks tab carries a ··· menu; the suggestions and checks list fade where they scroll; the textarea stays editable while the agent answers (only send disables).

**New mock API, with its future endpoint:** `getVaultDetail` (GET /v1/vaults/{id}), `listFiles` (GET /v1/vaults/{id}/files), `runChecks` (POST /v1/vaults/{id}/checks:run, per-check progress), `askAI` (POST /v1/vaults/{id}/chat, SSE tokens → `{ text, sources, cached }`). `auditVault` keeps POST /v1/vaults/{id}/audit but now answers with the room's route. Seeds cover Booking Web App, Logo Pack, Brand Guide and Landing Page.

