Here's the whole of VaultLance AI as it stands — a mock-data demo, no backend, everything runs in the browser.

**The instrument (landing)** — `/`
The hero is built from pre-rendered image sequences: a vault that opens on a keypad and wheel, a phone band that plays the vault's own sequence, scroll-driven sections and an overlay. Frames are decoded off the main thread in [clipWorker.ts](src/lib/clipWorker.ts) with a manifest-driven loader, and the boot gate waits for the vault paint rather than a timer. Tokens live in [hero-tokens.css](src/styles/hero-tokens.css); the golden scale (8/13/21/34/55/89/144/233, radius 13, durations 0.236–2.618s) is what the rest of the app inherits.

