- Running the suite regenerates screenshots under `docs/auth` and `docs/settings`; I reverted those so the only changes are the hero files.

One consequence worth knowing: the longer paragraph makes the hero taller than a 360×640 viewport, so that page now scrolls ~130px vertically. It fits without scrolling at 390×844 and at every desktop size.

